   "lines": [
    "Semi-annual in",
    "Botany.",
    "O, I made a",
    "miserable failure",
    "in my crack",
    "examination,",
    "three weeks ago,",
    "owing to being",
    "forced to sit",
    "up all the previous",
    "night with the",
    "asthma. It was",
    "terribly hard",
    "luck; thank",
    "heavens I am",
    "not of a nature",
    "to take things",
    "hardly."
   ],
